tags: static
remediation: Remove the literal from source and rotate the credential it names.
  A client secret, bearer token or credential in source is a long-lived credential and
  must be treated as compromised once committed; issue it at runtime instead.
references: CWE-798

# The UNQUOTED half of the matrix, and the one this ticket exists for: a
# .env / shell / Dockerfile ENV / compose / CI `KEY=value` line with no
# quotes at all.  See the header for why this record - and only this record -
# is anchored to line-start assignment syntax.
id: SAST-SEC-ENV_ASSIGNMENT-01
title: Hardcoded credential in an unquoted assignment
severity: high
confidence: medium
cwe: CWE-798
owasp: A07:2025
pattern: ^[[:space:]]*(-[[:space:]]+)?([A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*:[[:space:]]+)?(([Ee][Xx][Pp][Oo][Rr][Tt]|ENV|ARG|[Rr][Ee][Aa][Dd][Oo][Nn][Ll][Yy]|[Dd][Ee][Cc][Ll][Aa][Rr][Ee]|[Ll][Oo][Cc][Aa][Ll])[[:space:]]+)?[A-Za-z0-9_-]*(([Pp][Aa][Ss][Ss]([Ww]([Oo][Rr])?[Dd]|[Pp][Hh][Rr][Aa][Ss][Ee])|[Pp][Ww][Dd])|([Aa][Pp][Ii]|[Aa][Cc][Cc][Ee][Ss][Ss])[_-]?[Kk][Ee][Yy]|([Ss][Ee][Cc][Rr][Ee][Tt]|[Tt][Oo][Kk][Ee][Nn]|[Cc][Rr][Ee][Dd][Ee][Nn][Tt][Ii][Aa][Ll]))[A-Za-z0-9_-]*[\"']?[[:space:]]*[:=][[:space:]]*[^\"'`[:space:]()<>{};,/~!$%@.=:-][^\"'`[:space:]()<>{};,]{5,}
dialect: ere
context-deny: \$\{
context-deny: \$\(
context-deny: [:=][[:space:]]*["'`]?\$
context-deny: \{\{
context-deny: %\(
context-deny: <%
context-deny: [:=][[:space:]]*["'`]?[!~/.<>*-]
context-deny: \b(var|local|module|data|each|count|path|terraform|self|this|props|opts|args)\.
context-deny: (os\.environ|getenv|GetEnv|process\.env|System\.getenv|Deno\.env|ENV\[|environ\[|Environment\.Get)
context-deny: (vault|Vault|VAULT|secretsmanager|SecretsManager|secretKeyRef|valueFrom|from_secret|fromSecret|resolve:|ssm:|arn:aws:|keyring|Keychain|KeyVault|azure_key)
